  "tips": "**Pergi ke suatu tempat**\n\n- **go to school** = pergi ke sekolah\n- **go to work** = pergi bekerja\n- **go home** = pulang ke rumah. **Tanpa** *to*: *go home*, bukan *go to home*.\n\nKata kerja lain:\n- **work** = bekerja\n- **study** = belajar\n- **by bus** = naik bus, **by motorcycle** = naik motor\n\nContoh: *I go to work by bus.* = Saya pergi bekerja naik bus.\n\n**from Monday to Friday** = dari Senin sampai Jumat.",
